<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>Core Verbs</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head>

<body>

<div class="container">

<div class="title">Core Verbs 🔥</div>

<div class="buttons">

<div class="btn">食べる (taberu) - කනවා</div>
<div class="btn">飲む (nomu) - බොනවා</div>
<div class="btn">行く (iku) - යනවා</div>
<div class="btn">来る (kuru) - එනවා</div>
<div class="btn">見る (miru) - බලනවා</div>

</div>

</div>

</body>
</html>
